      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Gato Arranhador. Tudo o que Meowth faz durante o dia é dormir. À noite, patrulha seu território com os olhos brilhando. Ele adora objetos reluzentes e, quando encontra algo cintilante, a moeda dourada em sua testa também começa a brilhar.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Meowth pode evoluir para Persian no nível 10 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Fake Out</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Fury Swipes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Feint Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Taunt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Pay Day</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Nasty Plot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Assurance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Captivate, Feint, Night Slash, Play Rough</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Agility, Amnesia, Assurance, Attract, Body Slam, Charm, Chilling Water, Confide, Covet, Dark Pulse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dream Eater, Echoed Voice, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fake Tears, False Swipe, Foul Play, Frustration, Gunk Shot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Voice, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Lash Out, Last Resort, Metal Claw, Nasty Plot, Pain Split, Pay Day, Payback, Play Rough, Power Gem, Protect, Psych Up, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Round, Screech, Seed Bomb, Shadow Ball, Shadow Claw, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Snarl, Snatch, Snore, Spite, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Throat Chop, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trailblaze, U-turn, Uproar, Water Pulse, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Amnesia, Assist, Charm, Covet, Flail, Foul Play, Hypnosis, Iron Tail, Last Resort, Odor Sleuth, Punishment, Snatch, Spite, Tail Whip</p>",
